WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.700
Narrator: Minute seventy. Every phone in the stand sounds at once.

00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:07.200
Narrator: It's an official emergency alert.

00:00:08.542 --> 00:00:14.342
Narrator: Thousands of fans look at their screens - and then they look at you.

00:00:14.742 --> 00:00:17.242
Narrator: What do they need from you?
